# fpl-starts

P(starts) model for Fantasy Premier League: archives the live FPL API,
derives a queryable SQLite layer, and predicts P(starts) via a validated
walk-forward lookup table. (README to be rewritten properly once the model
code is trimmed down to just this package's scope.)
